<section class="container slothjam-spotlight" aria-labelledby="slothjam-title"><div class="slothjam-copy"><p class="eyebrow">NEW GAME / STRATEGIC SLOTH ORIGINAL</p><span class="status">Playable demo · Browser</span><h2 id="slothjam-title">A little party.<br>A whole island of play.</h2><p>Sloth Jam is our cozy 3D party game for families: 59 one-minute games on a sloth island. One stick, one button and no reading, so kids aged six and up can play with their parents. Designed and built end to end by Remi Couture.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="https://remiclassic.github.io/sloth-jam/play/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="product_click" data-track-product="sloth-jam">Play the demo ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="https://slothjam.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="product_click" data-track-product="sloth-jam-site">Official site ↗</a></div><p class="slothjam-publisher">A Strategic Sloth LLC game. In development.</p></div><a class="slothjam-art" href="https://slothjam.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Visit the Sloth Jam site"><video src="/media/studio/sloth-jam.mp4" poster="/media/studio/sloth-jam.jpg" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="Sloth Jam gameplay"></video></a></section>
